  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">此模組旨在為沉浸工程加入更多種類的加工與能源生產機器。</span></p>\n<p><strong>目前僅為程式庫模組，配方與物品需自行透過數據包等工具添加（請參閱 Wiki）。</strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">目前已支援最新版 IE</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">已新增功能</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">蒸汽渦輪機</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">坩堝</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">工業電解槽（單方塊版本與多方塊結構）</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">窯爐（車載窯與迴轉窯）</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\">規劃中功能</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">蒸汽鍋爐</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">化學反應器</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">所有多方塊結構</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本專案採用 GNU GPL v3 授權。若您希望貢獻於本專案，請透過 <a href=\"https://github.com/TeamMoegMC/ImmersiveIndustry\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github</a> 或 Discord 與我們聯繫。</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>配方</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/TeamMoegMC/ImmersiveIndustry/wiki\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wiki</a></p>\n<p><strong>支援與聯繫我們</strong></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/BWn6E94\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/712310451408470098/widget.png?style=banner2\" alt=\"discord\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"></a></p>\n<p>您的支持讓我們能創作更多內容！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/TeamMoegProjects\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fafdian.com%252fa%252fteammoeg\" rel=\"nofollow\">愛發電</a></p>\n<p>您的名字將顯示在我們的網站上，並獲得 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/BWn6E94\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a> 中的特殊身分組。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252finfo.teammoeg.com%252fsupportlist.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">支援者名單</a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252finfo.teammoeg.com%252fsupportlistgold.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">黃金支援者名單</a></p>\n<p>除了 Discord，歡迎前往我們的 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fforum.teammoeg.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">TeamMoeg 論壇</a>。</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></span></p>",
